{"version":1,"content":"<p>【注意 ⚠️】知名資安研究員 Marcus Hutchins 近日發出警告，直至 11 月 5 日為止，Ubuntu 官方仍未完成 CVSS 評分高達 9.8 分的高危漏洞 CVE-2026-98432 的修補程式。</p><p>目前，已有攻擊者在全網大規模掃描暴露於重大 Linux 核心（Kernel）漏洞的 Ubuntu 伺服器，初步統計涉及 210 萬台正在網絡上裸跑中。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T17:25:30.660673+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T16:57:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:38:17.397963+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T17:18:16.585419+00:00","content_hash":"644df6a9a3023e352afcf52f237300a3cf4241213dc3d24bfd3b692012886a9d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}